<title>USA: Harland names president/CFO Amman chairman.</title>
<headline>Harland names president/CFO Amman chairman.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Amman, president and chief executive officer of John H. Harland Co, has been elected chairman, the company said Monday.</p>
<p>Amman succeeds Robert Woodson, who will remain on the board through the completion of his term, it said.</p>
<p>Harland is a supplier of checks, database marketing services and loan automation software to the financial industry.</p>
</text>
